Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.93,0:23:38.39,Tips,,0,0,0,,{\fn思源宋体 CN Heavy\fscy110\blur4\bord1\3c&H000000&\pos(1328,36)}发射模型火箭时的注意事项\N★请在导师的指导下进行。\N★在购买火药或引擎的相关物品，\N　以及发射时，要先取得相关许可。\N★必须遵守法律和规则，安全第一！
Comment: 0,0:24:16.71,0:24:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,MAIN
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.49,0:00:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我有个小礼物给你们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.03,0:00:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.54,0:00:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,注意脚下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.33,0:00:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.47,0:01:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得是在这里…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.66,0:01:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到我珍藏的秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.54,0:01:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,遥乃的秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.65,0:01:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.70,0:01:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,在灯塔的地下？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.27,0:01:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,俗话说灯下黑嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.24,0:01:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,开个玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.25,0:03:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,真是没想到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.91,0:03:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,灯塔下面居然会有地下室
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.40,0:03:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,像电影一样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.70,0:03:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,据说原本这里是偷偷加建的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.94,0:03:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,还要你们帮忙打扫 不好意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.62,0:03:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不用谢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.83,0:03:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,秘密基地 秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.16,0:03:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,请问 为什么宝木同学你会有地下室的钥匙呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.52,0:03:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不愧是海果
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.14,0:03:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,居然注意到了这点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.44,0:03:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不愧是海果 很敏锐
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.51,0:03:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我爷爷以前是这座灯塔的管理员
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.86,0:03:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,灯塔废弃之后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.28,0:03:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我和爷爷就把这里当成是秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.66,0:04:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,经常在这里玩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.67,0:04:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,然后呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.64,0:04:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我不小心弄丢了钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.79,0:04:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,最近就没怎么来过这里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.66,0:04:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那今天开始就又能随时在基地里玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.16,0:04:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 想玩就来玩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.92,0:04:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,幽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.92,0:04:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,钥匙给你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.78,0:04:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,给我？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.23,0:04:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我听到幽你住在灯塔里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.94,0:04:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,就一直担心你住得怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.80,0:04:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,所以请自由使用这个房间吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.27,0:04:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,遥乃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.39,0:04:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.31,0:04:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那么那么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.50,0:04:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,今后就把这里当做我们的秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.33,0:04:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,三个人的秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.02,0:04:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这原本就是遥乃的基地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.46,0:04:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,再说让我独占也太浪费了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.84,0:04:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.08,0:04:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这里承载着你的回忆 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.08,0:04:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你能经常过来玩 我会很开心的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.72,0:04:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的对
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.61,0:04:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.56,0:05:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,打倒瞬
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.03,0:05:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次作战会议
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.56,0:05:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,明天是周六
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.20,0:05:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们抓紧时间去采购吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.58,0:05:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,采购？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.48,0:05:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,就是说要一起出门吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.82,0:05:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.82,0:05:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟我们已经用了很多材料了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.06,0:05:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,胶带剩得不多了 要补充一些
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.32,0:05:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,然后 尾翼这次想用硬一点的塑料
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.83,0:05:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,还有？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.72,0:05:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,珍珠
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.72,0:05:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我想尝尝珍珠奶茶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.76,0:05:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,珍珠 奶茶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.60,0:05:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀 珍奶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.50,0:05:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们明天十点见
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.92,0:05:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,要出门咯 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.78,0:05:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐你那顽固的卷发
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.81,0:05:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,确实要好好打理一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.48,0:05:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,穗波
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.97,0:05:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你帮我梳理头发
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.12,0:05:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐你很少要我帮你打理
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.35,0:05:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你是要去哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.91,0:06:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,去市区买东西
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.98,0:06:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,海果
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.18,0:06:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Bonavuu
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.28,0:06:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma…Mativuu 宝木同学
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.20,0:06:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,明明还有十五分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.95,0:06:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你来得真早
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.48,0:06:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…嗯 我刚刚才到的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.63,0:06:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Bonavuu
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.18,0:06:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我来晚了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.96,0:06:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mativuu 你很准时哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.30,0:06:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Mativuu 我也是刚到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.90,0:06:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们先去买小型的材料吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.23,0:07:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,有好多塑料瓶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.64,0:07:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们真的能免费拿走吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.13,0:07:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.04,0:07:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,已经得到店里的许可了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.96,0:07:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这样明内同学就不用强迫自己喝饮料了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.43,0:07:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,但 但是这些
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.90,0:07:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,合适大小的塑料瓶很难找到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.48,0:07:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,都好小
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.52,0:07:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你们也要这个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.99,0:08:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.13,0:08:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.04,0:08:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,要几个
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.20,0:08:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,六个
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.96,0:08:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,给
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.61,0:08:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.40,0:08:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,给
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.05,0:08:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,非…非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.34,0:08:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,还好是个温柔的人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.16,0:08:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这样我们需要的东西都集齐了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.08,0:08:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,任务完成
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.86,0:08:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那么那么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.82,0:08:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来呢 接下来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.00,0:08:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,说的也是 既然还有时间
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.84,0:08:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,去玩咯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.90,0:09:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是大头贴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.66,0:09:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,闪闪发光的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.26,0:09:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是第一次拍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.52,0:09:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我 我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.99,0:09:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,海果你怎么全在边上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.80,0:09:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我不太习惯…拍照片
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.59,0:09:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那下一张就由你站在中间吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.12,0:09:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我…我没…没事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.61,0:09:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.48,0:09:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,被抓住的外星人？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.30,0:09:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,因为海果一直想要逃走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.25,0:09:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,拍得是不是有点奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.57,0:09:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,再拍一张吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.98,0:09:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不用了 这样就好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.11,0:10:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这张就好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.62,0:10:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,再来一张 再拍一张吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.04,0:10:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.49,0:10:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我想用春季限定样式并摆好姿势拍一次
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.38,0:10:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,幽好像还想再拍一次
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.77,0:10:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,珍珠奶茶 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.96,0:10:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,珍珠珍珠奶茶奶茶珍珠奶茶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.38,0:10:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,珍珠珍珠奶茶奶茶啦啦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.54,0:10:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是第一次像这样和别人一起玩
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.64,0:10:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 可以去文具店看一小会吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.00,0:10:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,当然可以
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.18,0:10:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,海果也来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.40,0:10:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.25,0:10:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,下次希望雷门同学也能一起来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.31,0:10:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀 高…跋…利？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.39,0:10:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是机器人动画呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.49,0:10:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,小学的时候在学校很流行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.42,0:10:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,初…初中的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.56,0:10:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,偷听到雷门同学说…她很喜欢这个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.84,0:11:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不许擅自偷听
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.60,0:11:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.13,0:11:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,真帅气呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.62,0:11:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那 那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.82,0:11:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,火…火箭的设计 用这个怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.07,0:11:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.16,0:11:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么要认真去做水火箭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.15,0:11:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,真蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.70,0:11:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,没有兴趣的事没必要去做
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.83,0:11:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,对她们来说也是一样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.56,0:11:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,只是制造火箭需要我的技术而已
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.23,0:11:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 既然互相之间没有兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.90,0:11:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那就结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.46,0:11:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这样不就好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.23,0:11:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这种比赛 我马上就让它结束
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.57,0:12:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,终于到了一决胜负的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.29,0:12:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,水火箭制作比赛 开幕啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.30,0:12:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,流星队的海果队员
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.16,0:12:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,请你发表一下 现在的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.67,0:12:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,流星队吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.56,0:12:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚刚想出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.87,0:12:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,请说下你现在的想法！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.03,0:12:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我要赢下比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.33,0:12:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,另一方 瞬同学
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.78,0:12:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,也请你发表一下想法
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.93,0:12:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我能回去了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.34,0:12:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,顺带问一下 今早吃了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.17,0:12:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.98,0:12:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢怎么调制味噌汤？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.50,0:12:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,听人说话！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.18,0:12:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,面包跟米饭 喜欢哪个？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.84,0:12:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,米饭啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.18,0:12:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你们搞的闹剧 别把我卷进来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.09,0:12:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,速战速决吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.96,0:12:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,比赛前的气氛铺垫是非常重要的！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.41,0:12:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那我问你 10天前的早饭吃了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.00,0:12:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,诶！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.57,0:12:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,10天前吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.67,0:12:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,诶 我想想…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.61,0:12:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,蠢材电波女
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.28,0:12:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,先把规则确认一下吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.75,0:12:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我想不起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.58,0:12:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,可以用两支火箭比赛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.82,0:12:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.76,0:13:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,双方各自发射两次火箭
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.52,0:13:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,之后以成绩较好的一次…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.10,0:13:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,靠最优成绩 分出胜负吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.04,0:13:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.25,0:13:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,让塑料瓶造的火箭飞得更远的一方就能取胜
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.11,0:13:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我没理解错吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.92,0:13:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.26,0:13:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我做先手
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.12,0:13:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,海果好帅气！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.03,0:13:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 来把它摆正吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.47,0:13:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.78,0:13:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,她们做的火箭
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.78,0:13:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,涂装酷似高拔力钢MKーⅢ的胸部装甲…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.28,0:13:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是错觉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.65,0:13:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不 肯定是凑巧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.25,0:13:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是凑巧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.01,0:13:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,3 2 1~
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.97,0:14:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,103米
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.83,0:14:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒！超过了100米！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.71,0:14:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是最佳纪录
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.06,0:14:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这哪怕是雷门同学也…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.92,0:14:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,海果
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.46,0:14:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.33,0:14:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.10,0:14:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的火箭的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.46,0:14:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,一定没问题的！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.08,0:14:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,飞得更径直 飞得更遥远
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.20,0:14:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,让这份心思 能够传达给雷门同学…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.89,0:15:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,第二发超过了110米…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.36,0:15:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这并不是在风向上吃了甜头
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.88,0:15:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,机体的精度 水压 空气压
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.37,0:15:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,均经过了相当严谨的调试呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.63,0:15:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,试射时 我的最远飞行距离是 107米
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.11,0:15:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,哪怕是刚刚的距离
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.41,0:15:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,也算挺理想的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.17,0:15:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,仅通过手动泵
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.90,0:15:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,很难再提高了吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.90,0:15:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,她们做的MKーⅢ 还挺厉害的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.62,0:15:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,真棒 真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.08,0:15:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,哼 别以为这就赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.49,0:15:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟我最后一发火箭 还没有发射呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.18,0:15:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,就你们那点记录
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.14,0:15:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我轻轻松松就能破掉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.86,0:15:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,就靠它了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.88,0:15:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.70,0:15:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,诶 怎么感觉 跟我印象中的水火箭不一样？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.96,0:15:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,水火箭？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.66,0:16:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在说什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.12,0:16:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你们造的是水推进火箭吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.17,0:16:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,禁止使用火药作为动力源的规矩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.67,0:16:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,没有吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.16,0:16:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,给我冲破天际！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.42,0:16:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,飞起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.84,0:16:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,到达高度 127米
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.82,0:16:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,是我赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.27,0:16:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.30,0:16:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不对 你投机取巧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.86,0:16:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这是投机取巧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.90,0:16:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你违规了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.11,0:16:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.22,0:16:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,只要外壳是塑料 就算用火药推动的火箭模型 也没有违规！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.16,0:16:51.80,Upper,,0,0,0,,说回来 3对1也太狡猾了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.84,0:16:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,输掉了 我输掉了…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.82,0:16:53.71,Upper,,0,0,0,,而且 你根本没飞多远
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.69,0:16:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这明明是 最后跟雷门同学交流的机会了…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.95,0:16:55.35,Upper,,0,0,0,,根本不能算赢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.20,0:16:57.95,Upper,,0,0,0,,高度也是距离的一种好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.54,0:16:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.86,0:17:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.00,0:17:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,输了这种比试 就摆出一副世界末日的表情…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.67,0:17:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这不就搞得我像一个恶人了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.18,0:17:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我说你 难得我拿了个好东西给你看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.32,0:17:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不要只看着地下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.37,0:17:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,真令人不爽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.91,0:17:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你想说什么 就说出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.02,0:17:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,败犬的嗥叫 我就听听吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.10,0:17:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.72,0:17:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 可以
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.08,0:17:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,想说什么 就说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.03,0:17:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,海果
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.46,0:17:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,无非就是帮忙造火箭
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.44,0:17:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,提供所需的零件之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.69,0:17:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这些利己 无聊的话吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.88,0:17:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,特意这样转弯抹角 比赛也赢不了我…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.83,0:17:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,雷 雷门同学…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.34,0:17:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,要博取我的同情心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.30,0:17:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那 那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.63,0:17:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你这样的指望 我会毅然地粉碎它！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.47,0:18:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你 你头上戴的护目镜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.06,0:18:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,真…真帅啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.44,0:18:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我 我从初中开始就一直…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.61,0:18:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,一直想跟你说
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.07,0:18:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你的护目镜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.84,0:18:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好…好…好…帅
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.76,0:18:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想试戴一下…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.32,0:18:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你说想要当面说的 就是这些？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.37,0:18:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.85,0:18:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.09,0:18:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,雷门同学
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.04,0:18:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不…不来学校了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.51,0:18:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,没有机会…说给你听
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.98,0:18:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,所以就
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.60,0:18:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我 要是能在学校里 再次见到你的话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.11,0:19:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.28,0:19:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,今天的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.43,0:19:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然很不甘心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.33,0:19:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,但是很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.18,0:19:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们下次再比吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.47,0:19:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.90,0:19:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,去买点喝的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.22,0:19:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,海果？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.99,0:19:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,很有她的风格
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.00,0:19:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,总感觉忘记了一开始的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.98,0:19:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,算了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.98,0:19:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,瞬
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.18,0:19:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也玩得很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.51,0:19:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们下次再见吧 瞬
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.15,0:19:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,下次就在学校见
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.20,0:19:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,海果
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.56,0:19:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,给我也买一份
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.86,0:19:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,还有遥乃的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.60,0:19:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,两位
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.84,0:19:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,自动贩卖机在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.62,0:19:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,什么情况
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.21,0:19:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那帮家伙到底是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.94,0:19:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,真无趣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.45,0:20:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,真是无趣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.00,0:20:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,检查鞋柜？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.04,0:20:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,瞬 今天有没有来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.54,0:20:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.72,0:20:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去教室吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.58,0:20:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Bonavuu
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.14,0:20:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,烦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.08,0:20:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,雷门同学
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.74,0:20:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你可别误会了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.59,0:20:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是因为出席天数不够才来的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.52,0:20:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,鞋子还是室外鞋呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.28,0:20:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,禁止脏鞋
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.90,0:20:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经拿抹布擦过了所以没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.41,0:20:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我忘记带室内鞋了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.97,0:21:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,够了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.35,0:21:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不要老是盯着我看
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.74,0:21:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,光凭你们的话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.28,0:21:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,就算倾尽一生也无法造出能飞往宇宙的火箭
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.04,0:21:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,看到你们的危险动作我就很烦躁
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.93,0:21:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,所以就稍微奉陪一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.80,0:21:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,在我积攒出席天数期间 顺带地…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.36,0:23:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,幽 幽
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.37,0:23:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,额头感应 我也要试试
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.42,0:23:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,OK
